#!args --verify-dirty
# the effect per drop target (ui.drop_effect_set): the page (#501, 322..540 x 285..373) answers
# per point as a web page does -- its left half copies, the top of its right half refuses, the
# bottom links.  `dragover expect` is what the platform would answer the source there (Windows'
# DragOver effect, XdndStatus, set_actions: the system's pointer); a drop takes that effect
theme light
# outside every target the window takes text and files with every effect (drop_accept): the
# modifier keys choose
dragover 600 480 text copy move link
dragover expect copy
dragover expect move shift
dragover expect link ctrl shift
# the other targets take every effect too (the default); files are never moved
dragover 82 229 text copy move link
expect text:"Ziehen: Text bei 82,229  Über: Text-Ziel" exists
dragover expect copy
dragover expect move shift
dragover 640 229 files copy move link
dragover expect copy shift
# the page: its left half copies, with Shift too (it takes no move)
dragover 370 330 text copy move link
expect text:"Ziehen: Text bei 370,330  Über: Seite (kopieren)" exists
dragover expect copy
dragover expect copy shift
shot build/dnd/effects_page.png 300 270 260 120
# the top of its right half refuses: no effect, no highlight
dragover 500 300 text copy move link
expect text:"Ziehen: Text bei 500,300  Über: Seite (keine)" exists
dragover expect none
dragover expect none ctrl
# the bottom links, files and URLs alike
dragover 500 355 url copy move link
expect text:"Ziehen: URL bei 500,355  Über: Seite (verknüpfen)" exists
dragover expect link
dragover 500 355 files copy move link
dragover expect link
# a source that does not offer the page's effect: refused there
dragover 500 355 text copy move
dragover expect none
dragleave
expect text:"Ziehen: -  Über: -" exists
# drops after the drag hovered there: the left half copies, the bottom links (for a source that
# allows linking), the top refuses (nothing happens: no drop on the page, no UIC_DROP)
dragover 370 330 text
drop 370 330 text "links"
expect text:"Abgelegt: Text -> Seite (kopieren)" exists
dragover 500 355 url copy link
drop 500 355 url https://example.org/c
expect text:"Abgelegt: URL -> Seite (verknüpfen)" exists
dragover 500 300 text
drop 500 300 text "oben"
expect text:"Abgelegt: URL -> Seite (verknüpfen)" exists
expect text:"UIC_DROP: -" exists
drop expect none
# a drop has an effect its source allows: a source that only copies is refused on the linking
# bottom, as the platform refuses such a drag there (before, the drop got the target's first
# effect); so is one that only moves on the copying left half -- the effects the drop gives
# itself count, not the hover's
dragover 500 355 text copy
dragover expect none
drop 500 355 text "nur kopieren"
drop expect none
dragover 370 330 text copy move link
drop 370 330 text "nur verschieben" allows move
drop expect none
expect text:"Abgelegt: URL -> Seite (verknüpfen)" exists
expect text:"UIC_DROP: -" exists
# outside the targets too: an effect the source does not allow becomes one it does; files that
# may only be moved are refused (files are never moved): no UIC_DROP
drop 600 480 text "lose" link allows copy move
expect text:"UIC_DROP: Text \"lose\" bei 600,480 (Fenster 0)" exists
drop expect copy
drop 600 470 files build/dnd/weg.txt allows move
expect text:"UIC_DROP: Text \"lose\" bei 600,480 (Fenster 0)" exists
drop expect none
# the app's own drags pick from the page's effects too: text onto the left half is copied (a
# plain drag would move), onto the bottom it is refused (the button allows copy and move)
drag #401 370,330
expect text:"Abgelegt: Text -> Seite (kopieren)" exists
expect text:"Ende: Text ziehen kopieren (1)" exists
drag #401 500,355
expect text:"Ende: Text ziehen keine (2)" exists
expect text:"Abgelegt: Text -> Seite (kopieren)" exists
expect_nowarn
